LegalEase – Project Design Phase
1. System Design
LegalEase is designed as a web-based application that allows users to create legal document drafts using AI. The system is divided into frontend, backend, AI processing, and database modules.

2. User Interface Design
The website contains:
Home page
Login/Register page

Document selection page

Information input form

Generated document page

Edit and preview page

Download page

User dashboard

3. System Architecture
User
  ↓
Frontend Website
  ↓
Backend Server
  ↓
AI Document Generator
  ↓
Generated Legal Draft
  ↓
Database
  ↓
Preview / Edit / Download

4. Main Modules
User Module
User registration and login

Manage profile

View saved documents

Document Module
Select document type

Enter required information

Generate document

Edit and preview document

Download document

AI Module
Understand user-provided information

Select appropriate template/structure

Generate a customized legal document draft

Explain complex clauses in simple language

Database Module
Stores:

User information

Document details

Generated documents

Saved drafts

5. Database Design
Example tables:

Users

User ID

Name

Email

Password

Documents

Document ID

User ID

Document Type

Content

Created Date

6. Technology Design
Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript

Backend: Node.js / Python

Database: MySQL / MongoDB

AI: AI API

Hosting: Cloud/web server

7. Security Design
Secure login

Password protection

Data encryption

Access control

Secure document storage

User privacy protection

8. System Workflow
Login/Register
      ↓
Choose Legal Document
      ↓
Enter Required Details
      ↓
Submit Information
      ↓
AI Generates Draft
      ↓
Preview Document
      ↓
Edit if Required
      ↓
Save / Download

9. Design Goal
The main goal of the design is to make LegalEase simple, fast, secure, and easy to use, even for users who have little knowledge of legal terminology.
